{
  "_comment": [
    "Starting model lists for the HawkNodes dropdowns.",
    "",
    "The `llm` ids below are confirmed present on GET /v1/models, which reports ~105",
    "chat models -- far more than are listed here. Set ATLAS_API_KEY before starting",
    "ComfyUI and the pack pulls the full list at startup, caching it to",
    ".models_cache.json. For anything still missing, pick the `custom` option and type",
    "the id into `model_override`. Atlas model ids are CASE SENSITIVE and mostly",
    "vendor-prefixed; the short names in Atlas's own docs (deepseek-v3, glm, minimax)",
    "are marketing labels and are rejected with a 400.",
    "",
    "xai/grok-4.3 is the one entry NOT confirmed against /v1/models, and it is marked",
    "vision:true so it exposes image inputs. If it 400s, the prefix is the likely",
    "culprit -- other providers appear as x-ai/ or xai-org/ elsewhere. Check with:",
    "  curl -s https://api.atlascloud.ai/v1/models -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ATLAS_API_KEY\" | grep -i grok",
    "and correct the slug here.",
    "",
    "`params` selects which widget group a model shows in the image nodes. Only the",
    "gpt-image-2 groups are confirmed against a working implementation; `generic`",
    "sends nothing beyond model/prompt/seed unless you set a size, which keeps",
    "unfamiliar models from 400-ing on a parameter they do not accept."
  ],

